      <div class="dag-health__hero"><div class="dag-health__ring" data-ring><span><b data-score>0</b><small data-band></small></span></div><div class="dag-health__hs"><p data-since></p><p data-drag></p></div></div>
      <section class="dag-health__parts" aria-label="What makes up the score"><h4>What makes up the score <span>points earned / available</span></h4><ul data-parts></ul></section>
